{% doc %}
  @prompt
    ```txt id="jef6sj"
    Create a premium enterprise SaaS “Measured Results / Outcomes” section for a Shopify landing page or B2B analytics website.
    
    STYLE DIRECTION:
    - Minimal high-end SaaS design
    - Soft light-gray background
    - Large centered content container
    - Clean editorial spacing
    - Rounded white cards with subtle borders
    - Soft shadows and elegant whitespace
    - Navy blue typography
    - Olive-green accent color for metrics and icons
    - Premium consulting presentation aesthetic
    - Figma-style enterprise UI
    
    SECTION HEADER:
    
    Small uppercase label:
    "MEASURED RESULTS"
    
    Large bold headline:
    "Documented Outcomes"
    
    Supporting paragraph:
    "The following results were measured over a 6-month period following Flow deployment across all 45 stores."
    
    Spacing should feel premium and spacious.
    
    ---
    
    OUTCOME CARDS:
    
    Create stacked vertical outcome cards with:
    - Rounded white/light-gray background
    - Thin subtle border
    - Soft shadow
    - Large padding
    - Clean spacing between cards
    
    Each card layout:
    LEFT:
    - Rounded soft-gray icon container
    - Minimal olive-green line icon
    - Bold navy title
    - Smaller muted subtitle
    
    RIGHT:
    - Large olive-green metric aligned right
    
    UNDER HEADER ROW:
    - Supporting paragraph description
    - Full-width subtle methodology box with light-gray background
    
    ---
    
    CARD 1
    
    Icon:
    Minimal analytics/trend icon
    
    Title:
    "Conversion Rate"
    
    Subtitle:
    "Traffic to transaction ratio"
    
    Metric:
    "+18%"
    
    Description:
    "Average conversion rate improvement across the store network. Stores that actively adjusted staffing based on Flow data saw conversion improvements ranging from 12% to 24%."
    
    Methodology box:
    "Measurement methodology: Conversion rate calculated as (transaction count / total traffic entries) × 100, measured daily and averaged over 6-month period. Compared against 6-month baseline period before Flow deployment."
    
    ---
    
    CARD 2
    
    Icon:
    Minimal people/team icon
    
    Title:
    "Labor Cost Reduction"
    
    Subtitle:
    "Staffing efficiency improvement"
    
    Metric:
    "-12%"
    
    Description:
    "Reduction in labor costs as a percentage of sales through better alignment of staffing with traffic patterns. Overstaffing during slow periods was reduced while peak coverage was maintained."
    
    Methodology box:
    "Measurement methodology: Labor hours compared against traffic volume and sales results. Calculated as (total labor cost / total sales revenue) × 100, comparing 6-month periods before and after Flow deployment."
    
    ---
    
    CARD 3
    
    Icon:
    Minimal dashboard/chart icon
    
    Title:
    "Manager Dashboard Usage"
    
    Subtitle:
    "Platform adoption rate"
    
    Metric:
    "92%"
    
    Description:
    "Percentage of store managers accessing Flow dashboards daily after 3-month deployment period. High adoption indicated managers found the platform valuable for daily operations."
    
    Methodology box:
    "Measurement methodology: Login analytics tracking unique manager logins per day, averaged over weeks 12–16 following deployment across all stores."
    
    ---
    
    CARD 4
    
    Icon:
    Minimal clock/timing icon
    
    Title:
    "Issue Response Time"
    
    Subtitle:
    "Time to identify and address problems"
    
    Metric:
    "Same-Day"
    
    Description:
    "Managers shifted from identifying performance issues the next day (via sales reports) to identifying and responding to issues during the same business day using real-time Flow data."
    
    Methodology box:
    "Measurement methodology: Qualitative assessment based on manager interviews and timestamped records of staffing adjustments in response to observed traffic patterns."
    
    ---
    
    BOTTOM NOTE SECTION:
    
    Create a highlighted informational note card with:
    - Very soft olive/cream background
    - Rounded corners
    - Thin olive border
    - Olive-green icon
    
    Title:
    "Important Note on Results"
    
    Paragraph:
    "These results reflect this specific customer's deployment and operational practices over a 6-month measurement period. Flow platform performance varies based on store format, market conditions, existing baseline performance, implementation quality, and how actively teams use the platform. These numbers should not be interpreted as guaranteed outcomes for other retailers."
    
    ---
    
    DESIGN DETAILS:
    - Apple-style spacing
    - Elegant typography hierarchy
    - Clean alignment
    - Enterprise analytics platform aesthetic
    - Minimal but polished UI
    - Responsive mobile stacking
    - Consistent card spacing
    - Professional B2B SaaS branding
    ```
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-measured-results-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: 80px 20px;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  .ai-measured-results__card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__card-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__icon-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.icon_border_radius }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__icon-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__card-title-group-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__card-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__metric-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.metric_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.metric_color }};
    text-align: right;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.body_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__methodology-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.methodology_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.methodology_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.methodology_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__methodology-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
  }

  .ai-measured-results__note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.note_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.note_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 32px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__note-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__note-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.note_icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__note-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__note-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.note_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .ai-measured-results__note-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.body_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-measured-results-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 16px;
    }

    .ai-measured-results__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-measured-results__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .ai-measured-results__headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-measured-results__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 28px 20px;
    }

    .ai-measured-results__card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .ai-measured-results__metric-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      text-align: left;
      font-size: {{ block.settings.metric_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-measured-results__note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<measured-results-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-measured-results-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
